  "document": "Laurie David\nLaurie Ellen David (née Lennard; born March 22, 1958) is an American environmental activist. She produced the Academy Award-winning \"An Inconvenient Truth\" and, most recently, teamed up with Katie Couric to executive produce \"Fed Up\", a film about the causes of obesity in the United States. She serves as a trustee on the Natural Resources Defense Council and a member of the Advisory Board of the Children's Nature Institute and is a contributing blogger to \"The Huffington Post\"."
